@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    PocStatus is a sample ASP.NET Core Razor Pages application used to exercise a CI/CD
    pipeline (GitHub Actions &rarr; container registry &rarr; Harness CD &rarr; Kubernetes)
    without any database, message queue, or other backing service to stand up first.
</p>
<p>
    It exists purely to prove the pipeline mechanics end-to-end: build, scan, push, deploy,
    and roll out &mdash; see the <a asp-page="/Status">Status</a> page for pod-level details.
</p>
